<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-19T11:00:49.170Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:00:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian forces have installed an interim administration in Tigray and are moving toward the Eritrean border, while a pro-government militia says it has seized the regional airport and reports Eritrean forces suffered losses there. The United States, through Secretary of State Marco Rubio, is urging both Ethiopia and Eritrea to de-escalate the fighting. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP. This update adds the militia’s capture of the airport, reported Eritrean casualties, and the involvement of Secretary Rubio, which were not mentioned in the prior briefing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1CMlhSbmxNcWxRM25XaHRydDNwb0UzeEFRRlUtQkZEbFViNHVfTi14SEpQZk45UzdVa2pwaFFKWjlVWWdSUi0tNQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNOS0wXzdyN2IzNjQ0aTVPYUhSRl9VRDd2RHFTdnVCT2E4Q1VScU9CVU9hX2lsV1JHNTRCQ3N4WWpLSE5xd2NZdWZ2OGhVa2h5b2twT19nZC1QQWxjUTVNcEU2QzNMa2R0THg1akZRZzlLNFMtSlBSbWZ4bEt1Zm1LVHRhYkltVzZJaDhoYWtLRTd4eXVjSS1JcWlnMXRlSGFYb0hwR2o2VWJxTERVOF9DYlJvamhNMnhp0gG_AUFVX3lxTE5HTF9ORkJiUDc1ZTh2YlB6aFdRQTRnZjAtTEZRTzlvQVpIMWJXd09CR0ZEbF9KcERfQXVVYkZrMGhFdk1mWGZvWGxrQ3lCeGhJalBMenZvS2NaNzQ5eWdfcnlRWGRSTTZxTjl2aGdIUENjMElUR19YSG83QVQyWlRtSHZMX2tsczBqZjFBN1Q1UWFYU2lNVFVhN1FEYlhIWDhDdURNaTNOSWR1S2diNDVncU5MNGJ1dG9NZU5USmZR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE5XaDZHb0sySnB1Mzl4Qnh4TjZvSU9OcjRfcGRnM0VkY2NNaTVrYjllTXZiSHlFUkNtcXZEMndVQzc2RjNmNlB6Um1ON0lxTUc4MVhQZEJoVmpZbXByT19LSkNhYmNiRGJpMXhncVVPSVlNQlk?oc=5&quot;&gt;kulu-media.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&q